  "notes": "Checklist tier. CVE-2026-27826: X-Atlassian-Jira-Url / X-Atlassian-Confluence-Url headers reached the fetcher unvalidated (dependencies.py:258-271, 463-478). The fix validates via validate_url_for_ssrf() with _check_dns_resolution() using socket.getaddrinfo (patched urls.py:156-175) but the resolved addresses are discarded; the client resolves again at connect time, which is the G7 resolve-then-discard TOCTOU shape to verify manually. Note the vulnerable urls.py also shows a G2-style regex blocklist in is_atlassian_cloud_url (lines 24-30); it is a cloud-vs-datacenter classifier, not the SSRF guard, so it is not separately labeled.",
